00:22:23,683 FINE  [by.softclub.mpz.sql.MpzQueryExecutor] (default task-31) executeQuery SQL= SELECT  PKB.PRODKINDID PRODUCTKINDID, PKB.PRODKINDNAME PRODUCTKINDNAME, PKD.PRODKINDDESC, NVL(PKB.ISNOTVISIBLEFORAGENT, 0) NOTFORAGENT, NVL(PKB.ISNOTVISIBLEFORCLIENT, 0) NOTFORCLIENT
FROM    CLM_OL_PRODKINDBANKREF PKB
