00:22:32,367 FINE  [by.softclub.mpz.sql.MpzQueryExecutor] (default task-23) executeQuery SQL=SELECT LD.LOANDATAID, S.SID, LD.PERSONALNUM, LD.STDCNTRKINDID, LD.PRODKINDID, LD.AGENTID, NVL(SA1.NVALUE, 0) ISCASCADERATE, LD.CLIENTID
                FROM CLM_OL_LOANDATA LD 
                     LEFT JOIN ( 
